      source 84
      target 2495
      tip_text "The Best Thin Slice in NYC! You won't go back for the thick ones!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 1012
      source 84
      target 4307
      tip_text "Steak &amp; Blue Cheese Salad my new favorite!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 1013
      source 86
      target 87
      tip_text "5stars across the board (1) informed and friendly staff, (2) inventive cocktails and wine list, (3) menu cover, (4) dishes are unlike anything you've had, (5) desserts will seduce you."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1014
      source 86
      target 225
      tip_text "Homemade pappardelle pasta with veal is where it's at."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1015
      source 86
      target 764
      tip_text "Great fare, cocktails and ambiance but beware the aggressive vultures that like to swarm, then attack. Pretending to speak another language usually helps."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1016
      source 86
      target 1252
      tip_text "Great selection of Argentinean Red Wines. Pesto linguine and curry mussels are delicious."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1017
      source 86
      target 1479
      tip_text "If you want to try flavors you've probably never tasted before, try the Pear Ravioli or Lemon Pasta, both incredibly tart (if that's your thing). Desserts are a home run in a new kind of ballpark."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1018
      source 86
      target 1479
      tip_text "Slap your tastebuds into shape with the raw and vegan offerings. Safer things on the menu (if this is your first raw experience) are the Lasagna and Tamales."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1019
      source 86
      target 1566
      tip_text "The chocolate chip cake with buttercream frosting will make you want to dive head first into the cake, insanely rich and so good."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1020
      source 86
      target 2054
      tip_text "Orange Blossom Lemonade is SO refreshing on a hot day. Their chai is incredibly delicious."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1021
      source 86
      target 2063
      tip_text "Everything, and I mean everything from Dressler is so well executed with beautiful explosion of flavors. The raspberry beret cocktail is refreshing and light. Duck is tender and melts in your mouth."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1022
      source 86
      target 2063
      tip_text "Top picks for Brunch: Eggs Benedict, Dressler and the Omelette. Fresh squeezed OJ has just the right amount of pulp and sweetness."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1023
      source 86
      target 2197
      tip_text "Burgers and fries, you can't go wrong. Reminds me of Shake Shack burgers, fight club worthy."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1024
      source 86
      target 2239
      tip_text "An unbelievable selection of yum risotto, great wine and paninis. Nice option for weekend lunch, when most restaurants in the area are closed til dinner."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1025
      source 86
      target 2299
      tip_text "Quiche, Fresh OJ, Cappuccino, should be tried, yum!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 1026
      source 86
      target 2299
      tip_text "Incredibly kind staff, charming &amp; romantic tunes that will make you feel like you're nestled up in a Parisian cafe."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1027
      source 86
      target 2299
      tip_text "Warm croissants with fresh raspberry jelly melts in your mouth."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1028
      source 86
      target 2725
      tip_text "Great coffee and a peach &amp; raspberry muffin that will bring you to your knees."
   ]
   edge [
