      source 86
      target 3626
      tip_text "Order the waffle with fresh berries, they serve them, along with whipped cream, in sundae cups, a definite treat!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 1033
      source 86
      target 3626
      tip_text "Skip the wait at Peels and come here for a lip-smackingly good brunch. Le Bucheron is a favorite. They have 14 varieties of house-made sausage for you meat lovers."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1034
      source 86
      target 3747
      tip_text "Steak Frites is perfect for a great cut of meat. Wait staff offers fantastic wine recs that have never let me down."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1035
      source 86
      target 3747
      tip_text "Sweet Corn soup is flavorful, buttery and perfect for Fall."
   ]
   edge [
      id 1036
      source 86
      target 3787
      tip_text "Fresh lemonade and black and white cake make the world go round!!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 1037
      source 86
      target 3951
      tip_text "Strawberry lemonade is sweet but rocks the house. If you want bread, you have to ask for it, it's their policy."
   ]
   edge [
