      source 251
      target 2697
      tip_text "For brunch. Try the veal grillades. Amazing. Start off with the monkey bread with a spicy bloody mary."
   ]
   edge [
      id 2652
      source 251
      target 2697
      tip_text "Start off with a house cocktail. Then get an ap. Menu changes often but there are favs that have stuck around like the shrimp, grits and sausage. It will not disappoint. And the tots are epic."
