      target 1543
      tip_text "They reuse the soup noodles--really unsanitary!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4840
      source 757
      target 2395
      tip_text "I know everyone loves this place, and it is good, but why not have coffee refills? Ridiculous."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4841
      source 757
      target 3629
      tip_text "Very friendly service, generous portions and strangely absolutely NO refills on soft drinks. Come on...its the 21st century!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4842
      source 757
      target 4357
      tip_text "These people are consistently polite--rarity."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4843
      source 757
      target 4518
      tip_text "I think Starbucks policy with regard to ice water is, from a business perspective (not to mention a psychological one), pathetic."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4844
      source 757
      target 5340
      tip_text "Some of the employees are amazing. Some."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4845
      source 758
      target 759
      tip_text "Go to Florio's to enjoy great sigars, inside. You'll probably feel like you're in a soprano's episode. You might run into John Perry Barlow."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4846
      source 760
      target 761
      tip_text "Not as good as Chinatown, but not bad for this neck of the woods. You can order off menu."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4847
      source 760
      target 2375
      tip_text "crab meat salad and tri color roll"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4848
      source 760
      target 4765
      tip_text "#45 - grilled beef over tiny rice sticks and an order of large spring rolls for appetizer"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4849
      source 760
      target 5436
      tip_text "Western Burger all the way"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4850
      source 760
      target 5491
      tip_text "The rumora are true, it's alot of food"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4851
      source 763
      target 762
      tip_text "With all the mobster photos lining the walls, there\u2019s no hiding the mafia connection behind this East Harlem institution - I'd buy some of their pasta sauces on the way out, you filthy animal!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4852
      source 765
      target 764
      tip_text "The bartender who wears all the different ties is GREAT!!!!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4853
      source 765
      target 2379
      tip_text "Worst service ever! Went here with a large group and they gave my vegetarian friend a pasta dish with chicken and claimed it was fish. Totally unprofessional, the manager was the worst!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4854
      source 767
      target 766
      tip_text "Even if it is not on the menu, ask for the Gator Burger... We eat here every time we're in NYC. This place is the best you'll get outside NO! Who Dat?"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4855
      source 767
      target 766
      tip_text "The Jambalaya is really good too and their Hurricanes are authentic."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4856
      source 767
      target 3345
      tip_text "Best hole in NYC. Light mood, easy crowd (if you can call it a crowd). Really love this place!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4857
      source 767
      target 3735
      tip_text "WOW! The Foie Gras w\/ truffle is very nice. Great veal dish, very creative and tasty. Would go back."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4858
      source 769
      target 768
      tip_text "Love the cuban food and fun atmosphere"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4859
      source 769
      target 3500
      tip_text "Best strawberry Mojitos in the city! Have a dinner at the bar, it's more fun!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4860
      source 769
      target 4703
      tip_text "My new favorite diner!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4861
      source 769
      target 5260
      tip_text "Nothing to scream about, unless you are tourist or coming from Jersey Shore to drink for your life in the city..."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4862
      source 769
      target 5357
      tip_text "What, they went to hunt that bison to Alaska?"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4863
      source 770
      target 768
      tip_text "The Churrasco is amazing. Finish it off with the Pastelillos de guava and queso blanco and you're set."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4864
      source 770
      target 2554
      tip_text "The Salmon Teriyaki lunch box is the best deal in Astoria! It's so good!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4865
      source 770
      target 2708
      tip_text "The eggs benedict are a must! So savory &amp; delicious."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4866
      source 770
      target 2745
      tip_text "Service was poor. Waitress kept us waiting even though restaurant was pretty empty. Asparagus was disappointing, croquettes were good but order only brings two. Overall it was forgettable."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4867
      source 770
      target 4342
      tip_text "Everything we had was delicious! We had the grilled vegetable appetizer, tomato &amp; her croquettes and the beefteki. Plus they gave us a complimentary yogurt dessert!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4868
      source 770
      target 4688
      tip_text "Wild Mushroom Appetizer was super tasty. I also loved the Grilled Chicken Bordeaux with butternut squash raviolli, sauce was delicious."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4869
      source 770
      target 5065
      tip_text "The 48hr organic chicken was really amazing!"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4870
      source 770
      target 5630
      tip_text "Their .99 cent pizza is not worth .99 cents... I do not recommend it, too thin, barely any cheese and it upset my stomach. I recommend Maoz next door."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4871
      source 770
      target 5717
      tip_text "I recommend the whole wheat steak wrap with your choice of toppings, a pomegranate tea and cheddar chips, all were fresh and very delicious."
   ]
   edge [
      id 4872
      source 771
      target 772
      tip_text "So many good tapas to choose from. Didn't even get to the paella. Bacon wrapped shrimp was underwhelming but the croquetas were bomb. Check in on foursquare for free sangria. (3 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4873
      source 771
      target 1322
      tip_text "This was bomb. Blueberry pancakes for the win. Get a side of bacon and try the hot apple cider. Or the brunch cocktails and milkshakes looked good. Be here early, wait is\u2026 (4 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4874
      source 771
      target 1602
      tip_text "Love this place. Time it right to get a seat and enjoy a burger (or two) with the works. Not too long a line on off-meal hours. (3 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4875
      source 771
      target 1625
      tip_text "It was pretty damn awesome. Just think it's way overpriced. It's not twice as good as places like Jean Georges or Le Bernardin. But top notch. Ask for a tour of the kitchen\u2026 (4 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4876
      source 771
      target 1666
      tip_text "Surprisingly fresh $1 oysters for happy hour every day from 7-10pm. Service isn't always great but the oyster special makes up for it in my book. (2 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4877
      source 771
      target 1743
      tip_text "Pulled pork was great. Big seating area in the back with big tv's and I think an upstairs. Outta the way for most but if you're in the hood, definitely worth a look. (3 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4878
      source 771
      target 1900
      tip_text "Brunch was great. I housed the (grass-fed) steak and eggs and the granola in yogurt was bomb. Live music on Sundays, rag\/bluegrass, real fun. Def going back. (4 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4879
      source 771
      target 2313
      tip_text "Pricey, but it's grass-fed beef! Get a lettuce wrap and you've got yourself a nice Paleo (read: no carb) meal. Tip: fork and knife it. Need to come back to try the shake. (3 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4880
      source 771
      target 2325
      tip_text "Lots of changes since I last went years ago but still great burgers. And what could be better than alcoholic milkshakes?! Couple outdoor seats for fair weather days. (4 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4881
      source 771
      target 2595
      tip_text "Bacon wrapped apricot not as good as I had hoped when I was there last. But I remember lunches have been solid and they have some nice cocktails and beers. (2 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4882
      source 771
      target 2745
      tip_text "Went for brunch. Portions are small. The croissant and French toast were great. Soldaditos were yum but very small. Get the cracked peppers and chorizo and eat them together (3 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4883
      source 771
      target 2763
      tip_text "Sweet little Swiss spot. A go-to for brunch. Muesli pancakes are awesome. Seriously, awesome. You must get the pancakes. I don't care about your diet restrictions. Get them. (4 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4884
      source 771
      target 3010
      tip_text "The wild boar lasagna is a must try. Go here just for that. One of those things where you won't even try anything else on the menu. (3 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4885
      source 771
      target 3099
      tip_text "$2 smoothies until the 1\/19\/12! Find them online and go! (3 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4886
      source 771
      target 3345
      tip_text "Great beer selection. Five blocks up from the other HOB. Get the chili or the jalapeño sliders. This one has outdoor seating and an upstairs. (3 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4887
      source 771
      target 3725
      tip_text "Meh. I was decently full after for $25 (tho I ate a lil bit right before). Friend pointed out the ginger was funky. Quality of the tuna and eel was < mediocre. I MIGHT go\u2026 (2 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4888
      source 771
      target 4572
      tip_text "This is real sushi. They dont do rolls so theres no hiding the quality of the fish behind special sauces and all that. Fresh fish, fresh wasabi, real ginger. Want the Omakase (4 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4889
      source 771
      target 4955
      tip_text "I was incredibly underwhelmed. But could just be me because the line was really long and everyone seems to love it. (1 of 4 petals via Fondu)"
   ]
   edge [
      id 4890
      source 771
      target 5153
